{"seq":1,"slug":"ablating-harnesses","title":"Harness 消融：分离模型与脚手架贡献","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-harness-design/evaluation-evolution/ablating-harnesses","wordCount":2111,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"harness-消融-分离模型与脚手架贡献\">Harness 消融：分离模型与脚手架贡献</h1><p>季度汇报上有人说：「我们的 agent 成功率从 22% 提到了 30%。」第一个问题不该是「怎么做到的」，而是「涨的这八个点，属于模型、属于脚手架，还是属于评测口径的变化」。答不清这个问题，工程决策就是在雾里开车——该停掉的脚手架被继续供养，真正有效的投资反而拿不到预算。消融实验是唯一能把这份功劳簿算清楚的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种混淆来源\">核心概念：三种混淆来源</h2><p>归因困难来自三处。<strong>其一，系统是乘性的</strong>：第一章已论证成功率近似为模型可靠率与 harness 供给率的乘积（推导见<a href=\"../anatomy/what-is-a-harness\">Harness 是什么：模型之外的另一半</a>），两个因子同时变动时，单看总量的变化无法分解。<strong>其二，公开榜单天然混装</strong>：排行榜上的每一行都是「某脚手架 + 某模型」的组合，同一底座经不同外壳包装后的成绩差异可以大到淹没模型间的差距，SWE-agent 论文用 ACI 消融直接证明了界面形状本身就是性能变量（arXiv <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15793\">2405.15793</a>）。<strong>其三，评测外壳自身带噪</strong>：SWE-bench 上线后被社区发现部分任务的测试判分存在问题，OpenAI 于 2024 年联合人工校验筛出 500 个可靠子集即 SWE-bench Verified，此后它成了比原版更常被引用的口径（<a href=\"https://www.swebench.com/\">swebench.com</a>）——连「分数的地板」都需要一次消融才能确认。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    FULL[完整系统的成绩] --&gt; A[固定脚手架 只换模型]&#10;    FULL --&gt; B[固定模型 只换脚手架]&#10;    FULL --&gt; C[逐个拆组件 工具集 压缩 权限档位]&#10;    A --&gt; RA[模型侧贡献]&#10;    B --&gt; RB[脚手架整体贡献]&#10;    C --&gt; RC[组件级归因与交互项]\">flowchart TD\n    FULL[完整系统的成绩] --&gt; A[固定脚手架 只换模型]\n    FULL --&gt; B[固定模型 只换脚手架]\n    FULL --&gt; C[逐个拆组件 工具集 压缩 权限档位]\n    A --&gt; RA[模型侧贡献]\n    B --&gt; RB[脚手架整体贡献]\n    C --&gt; RC[组件级归因与交互项]</pre><h2 id=\"二阶分解-把贡献写成账本\">二阶分解：把贡献写成账本</h2><p>设四个配置的任务成功率：双低基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\varnothing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6377em;vertical-align:-0.2072em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2572em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord amsrm mtight\">∅</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2072em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（弱模型加最简脚手架）、仅换强模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、仅上完整脚手架 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、双高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{MH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。三个效应各自独立记账：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_M = s_M - s_{\\varnothing}, \\qquad \\Delta_H = s_H - s_{\\varnothing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msu