ght\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型侧贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是脚手架整体贡献，最后的交互项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{MH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回答「两者是否互相成就」：显著为正说明好模型放大了好脚手架的价值（常见于工具面充分的场景）；接近零或为负则说明脚手架在替模型补课，模型进步后应考虑拆除。这套二阶设计是统计里的标准析因思路，成本仅为四组配置，却是多数团队从未做过的实验。</p>\n<p>单次运行的成功率本身带方差：成功率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立运行的标准误是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{p(1-p)/n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，要把标准误压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 在千次量级——这意味着严肃的消融要么用大样本小任务套件，要么接受「方向性结论」的定位而不追逐三位有效数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个数值例子\">一个数值例子</h3><p>把公式代入假设数字以固定直觉。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\varnothing} = 12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6377em;vertical-align:-0.2072em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2572em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord amsrm mtight\">∅</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2072em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>（小模型加裸循环）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_M = 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>（换旗舰模型）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_H = 26\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26%</span></span></span></span></span>（原模型加上完整脚手架）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{MH} = 45\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45%</span></span></span></span></span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_M = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 个点、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_H = 14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 个点、交互项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{MH} = 45 - 12 - 8 - 14 = 11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span> 个点。解读：脚手架单独贡献最大，但真正的头条是那个 11——好模型与好外壳强烈互相成就，这类系统值得同步投资两侧；反之若算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，说明外壳的复杂度正在替模型补课，应优先考虑简化。注意所有数字都建立在同一任务套件、同一判分器与足够重复次数之上，否则分解本身没有意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组件级消融协议\">组件级消融协议</h2><p>整体归因之后才是细粒度拆解。每个 harness 组件都值得一列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>被消融组件</th>\n<th>具体操作</th>\n<th>主要度量</th>\n<th>能回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型底座</td>\n<td>同一脚手架下替换模型版本</td>\n<td>解决率增量</td>\n<td>这次模型升级对我值多少钱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具集</td>\n<td>移除或替换单个工具</td>\n<td>解决率与平均轮数</td>\n<td>该接口是否必要、形状是否最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环预算</td>\n<td>调整最大轮数或采样次数</td>\n<td>预算-性能曲线</td>\n<td>边际收益在何处饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文策略</td>\n<td>关闭自动压缩或检索注入</td>\n<td>长任务完成率与 token 成本</td>\n<td>管理机制的真实回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限档位</td>\n<td>收紧与放宽审批模式</td>\n<td>完成率与人工干预次数</td>\n<td>自治度定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>执行时有一条铁律：<strong>一次只动一个变量</strong>，且每格配置都要跑满预设的重复次数。实践中最常见的翻车是「顺手优化」——消融工具集的同时悄悄改了提示词，结果两组差异无法归因。把配置固化到代码仓库、用无头模式批量驱动 harness（见<a href=\"../engineering-details/event-stream-ux\">事件流与可观测 UI</a>），可以让每组实验成为可重跑的一条命令。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文献里已有的三个教训\">文献里已有的三个教训</h2><p>不必事事从头做实验，三个经典结果划定了预期区间。<strong>教训一：接口比想象中贵</strong>。SWE-agent 的消融显示编辑窗口大小、文件查看方式这类看似琐碎的接口选择会实质性移动解决率，作者由此提出 ACI 应作为一等设计对象（arXiv <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15793\">2405.15793</a>）。<strong>教训二：复杂度不是资产</strong>。Agentless 用无循环的三段流水线拿到 27.33% 的 Lite 解决率与约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.34</mn><mtext>的单件成本，胜过一众复杂</mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>——任何新增机制都必须在与这种朴素基线的对照中证明自己（</mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2407.01489</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2407.01489</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>）。</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>教训三：模型侧在快速漂移</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>。</mtext><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mtext>测得模型可完成任务的时长地平线约每七个月翻番（</mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2503.14499</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2503.14499</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>），意味着模型侧贡献项</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.34 的单件成本，胜过一众复杂 agent——任何新增机制都必须在与这种朴素基线的对照中证明自己（arXiv [2407.01489](https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01489)）。**教训三：模型侧在快速漂移**。METR 测得模型可完成任务的时长地平线约每七个月翻番（arXiv [2503.14499](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.14499)），意味着模型侧贡献项</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.34</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的单件成本，胜过一众复杂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">——</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">任何新增机制都必须在与这种朴素基线的对照中证明自己（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2407.01489</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ttp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">//</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/2407.01489</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）。</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">教训三：模型侧在快速漂移</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">测得模型可完成任务的时长地平线约每七个月翻番（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2503.14499</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ttp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">//</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/2503.14499</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">），意味着模型侧贡献项</span></span></span></span></span>\\Delta_M$ 在持续通胀——去年归因给脚手架的能力，今年可能已被模型吸收，消融因此不是一次性审计而是定期体检，复测节奏与「升级日流程」的衔接见<a href=\"design-evolution\">设计演进的驱动力</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个最小可执行的消融计划\">一个最小可执行的消融计划</h2><p>消融不需要研究级预算，两周的紧凑计划足以拿到第一批可信结论。<strong>第 1 至 2 天：固定底座。</strong> 选 30 到 50 个有判定器、单次成本可控的任务（真实仓库的小型缺陷修复或脚本化数据任务），把判分自动化，跑通「一条命令驱动全部配置」的无头管道——这一步的质量决定后面所有数字的可信度。<strong>第 3 至 5 天：跑四格析因。</strong> 弱模型加裸循环、强模型加裸循环、弱模型加完整外壳、强模型加完整外壳各重复 10 次，记录成功率、平均轮数与 token 成本三列，按上文公式算出三个效应。</p>\n<p><strong>第二周：组件切片与报告。</strong> 在最强配置上逐个关闭压缩、检索、计划模块各跑 10 次，得到组件级归因表；最后把全部数字连同任务清单、判分器版本、随机种子写成一页备忘。整份计划的预算大约是数百次小任务运行，换来的是一份能终结架构争论的归因表。它最大的价值往往在半年后：当有人提议「加个多代理层」时，你可以指着表格说清楚上一轮每个机制的边际收益是多少个点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与评测体系的分工\">与评测体系的分工</h2><p>最后划一条界线以免重复建设：本篇关心的是<strong>用受控实验回答设计问题</strong>，被测对象是自己的 harness；系统的评测方法论——任务怎么选、judge 怎么校准、统计功效怎么算——是另一个完整的学科，其结论可以直接为本篇的协议所引用，例如重复次数的决定就应交给功效分析而不是拍脑袋。两者的关系类似临床药学与制药工艺：前者提供测量纪律，后者据此决定配方。当你的消融开始产出稳定的组件级归因表时，它同时也是一份给评测体系的需求说明书。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>归因三坑：乘性结构、榜单混装、评测外壳自带噪声。</li>\n<li>四配置二阶分解给出模型贡献、脚手架贡献与交互项三笔账。</li>\n<li>组件级消融一次只动一个变量，配置入库、命令可重跑。</li>\n<li>经典教训：接口影响大、朴素基线必须对照、模型贡献持续通胀需定期复测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Harness 消融：分离模型与脚手架贡献","id":"harness-消融-分离模型与脚手架贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种混淆来源","id":"核心概念-三种混淆来源"},{"level":2,"text":"二阶分解：把贡献写成账本","id":"二阶分解-把贡献写成账本"},{"level":3,"text":"一个数值例子","id":"一个数值例子"},{"level":2,"text":"组件级消融协议","id":"组件级消融协议"},{"level":2,"text":"文献里已有的三个教训","id":"文献里已有的三个教训"},{"level":2,"text":"一个最小可执行的消融计划","id":"一个最小可执行的消融计划"},{"level":2,"text":"与评测体系的分工","id":"与评测体系的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件流与可观测 UI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-harness-design/engineering-details/event-stream-ux"},"next":{"title":"编排多个 harness","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-harness-design/evaluation-evolution/orchestrating-many-harnesses"}}